{"term":{"label":"性","occurrences":1,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"3A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i","title":"滕文公上","description":"滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"他","id":"他"},{"form":"助","id":"助"},{"form":"問","id":"問"},{"form":"善","id":"善"},{"form":"國","id":"國"},{"form":"孟子","id":"孟子"},{"form":"性","id":"性"},{"form":"恆","id":"恆"},{"form":"教","id":"敎"},{"form":"治","id":"治"},{"form":"獸","id":"獸"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"莫","id":"莫"},{"form":"見","id":"見"},{"form":"道","id":"道"},{"form":"陳","id":"陳"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.5032557884561966,"source":"獸","target":"國"},{"weight":2.1355310083308794,"source":"獸","target":"道"},{"weight":1.1169614273363062,"source":"莫","target":"國"},{"weight":1.5224265354444706,"source":"莫","target":"助"},{"weight":2.3978952727983707,"source":"莫","target":"善"},{"weight":1.5224265354444706,"source":"莫","target":"治"},{"weight":2.1355310083308794,"source":"恆","target":"道"},{"weight":1.1169614273363062,"source":"治","target":"助"},{"weight":1.2992829841302609,"source":"治","target":"善"},{"weight":2.3978952727983707,"source":"敎","target":"善"},{"weight":2.908720896564361,"source":"陳","target":"見"},{"weight":1.8971199848858813,"source":"陳","target":"孟子"},{"weight":1.3862943611198906,"source":"善","target":"孟子"},{"weight":3.784189633918261,"source":"善","target":"性"},{"weight":1.2192402764567245,"source":"善","target":"道"},{"weight":1.586965056582042,"source":"善","target":"國"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"善","target":"助"},{"weight":2.3491051086289385,"source":"他","target":"問"},{"weight":1.8971199848858813,"source":"他","target":"孟子"},{"weight":2.2155737160044158,"source":"他","target":"見"},{"weight":1.7300659002227152,"source":"王","target":"道"},{"weight":2.995732273553991,"source":"性","target":"孟子"},{"weight":2.82867818889